---
import Details from '@/Details.astro'
---

<div class="flex flex-col mx-auto gap-12.5 w-[70ch]">
  <h3 class="text-h2">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
  <div class="flex flex-col">
    <Details summary="What is the best time to visit this destination?">
      <p>
        The best time depends on the kind of trip you want. Some travelers prioritize easier weather
        and smoother movement, while others are happy to trade that for quieter periods or a more
        atmospheric landscape.
      </p>
    </Details>

    <Details summary="How many days should I spend here?">
      <p>
        For most travelers, two to four nights is enough to get a meaningful feel for a destination.
        A longer stay makes more sense if the place rewards slower pacing, deeper cultural context,
        or a more immersive hotel experience.
      </p>
    </Details>

    <Details summary="Is this a good destination for families?">
      <p>
        Often yes, but it depends on the children’s ages and the family’s travel style. Some
        destinations work best for slower, experience-led trips, while others are easier if you need
        short transfers and more built-in convenience.
      </p>
    </Details>

    <Details summary="How do we start planning?">
      <p>
        The process usually starts with a conversation about where you want to go, how you like to
        travel, and what kind of experience you want the journey to leave you with. From there, the
        itinerary is shaped around fit, pace, and priorities.
      </p>
    </Details>
  </div>
</div>
